.RE
.TP
\f[B]Snapshot=\f[R]
Download packages from the given snapshot instead of downloading the
latest distribution packages from the given mirror.
Takes a snapshot ID (the format of the snapshot ID differs per
distribution), use the \f[B]latest\-snapshot\f[R] verb to figure out the
latest available snapshot.
.RS
If this setting is configured and \f[B]Mirror=\f[R] is not explicitly
configured, different default mirrors are used:
.PP
.TS
tab(@);
lw(13.3n) lw(30.0n) lw(26.7n).
